# Cerebral Download counts X "only once, as Cerebral Download resolves" (the ruling): an artifact destroyed in response is
# not counted. Bot1 casts Dimir Spybug on turn 1 with Mox Sapphire, Sol Ring and Mox Jet also out. On turn 3 Bot1 casts
# Cerebral Download with three artifacts, and in response Bot2 casts Disenchant on Mox Sapphire. As the Download
# resolves Bot1 controls two artifacts: it surveils 2, looking at Counterspell and Lightning Bolt only (every card looked
# at must be placed, so Ponder beneath is not among them), puts both into the graveyard and draws Ponder and two Islands.
# The Spybug gets its one counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Sol Ring
Mox Jet
Dimir Spybug
Cerebral Download
Swamp
Island
Counterspell
Lightning Bolt
Ponder
Island
Island
Island
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Plains x4
Plains x10

